msgstr "Azure Blob Storage"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1161
msgid "No cloud provider is connected. Media is served from this server."
msgstr ""
"Kein Cloud-Anbieter ist verbunden. Die Medien werden von diesem Server "
"ausgeliefert."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1163
